  "details": "1. Open vrchat\n\n2. Open Chatbox\n\n3. Write '{1}' - or different number (except for zero)\n\n4. Send message\n\n5. You will send nothing but you will get an error in the console\n\nERROR: [LOCALIZATION] You are most likely trying to set a different number of args into the string \"{1}\".\n\nSystem.FormatException: Index (zero based) must be greater than or equal to zero and less than the size of the argument list.\n\n(Also possible to see others peoples message error)\n\nWorking on Beta and Release Builds",
